    </developer>
    <project_group>FOSSASIA</project_group>
    <description>
        <p>An intuitive app for creating, customizing, and transferring dynamic text and vector graphics to Bluetooth LED name badges.</p>
        <p>Badge Magic turns your device into a portable studio for LED badge customization. Featuring an 11×44 grid editor, multi-badge slot management, and seamless Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) transfer, it allows makers, event organizers, and hobbyists to program custom badges effortlessly.</p>
        <p>Key features include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>22 Animation Effects (including Pacman, Digital Rain, Fireworks, and scrolling text)</li>
            <li>3 Visual Effects: Flash, Invert, and Marquee</li>
            <li>Pixel-art drawing editor with shape tools (Square, Circle, Triangle) and Undo/Redo</li>
            <li>Save, edit, import, and export custom badge layouts</li>
            <li>Batch transfer up to 8 badges via Bluetooth Low Energy</li>
            <li>Multi-language support and custom Bluetooth device alias management</li>
        </ul>
        <p>More feature on our personalized firmware!</p>
    </description>
